Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1289.8,416.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Police Investigation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1312,460.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Goes Nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550,748.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Male Body Found in Kanda River
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the body of an unidentified male was found\Nin the Konda River in Chioda City, Tokyo.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.49,0:01:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(577.8,710)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Battles Without Moe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The remains were badly mutilated,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and police are working to identify\Nthe deceased as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(529.8,468.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This Year's
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(528.4,517.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Lady Omoe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's crazy in here. So busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you could help\Naround here as well, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't have enough hands, I\Ncould always hire some new mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're allowed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:02:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are raking it in\Nthanks to the Lady Omoe effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, you should\Nstop talking and get us some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get to have some noobies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome back! Oka! Oka! Oka!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Okachimachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's such a horrible way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.17,0:02:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okachimachi's been offed on so-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that doesn't spell radio anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.70,0:02:26.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,44.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Radio Building
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rady Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're for someone inside the suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have something on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This note is to notify\Nyou that the Oinky Doon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Café is hereby disowned\Nfrom the Creatureland...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,227)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DISOWNMENT NOTICE
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,302)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Greetings, we trust that you are all doing well.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,378)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This is to notify you that Oinky Doink Café is
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,454)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}hereby disowned from the Creatureland Group.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,529)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink Manager: Yasuko Yaegashi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,605)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink Members: Yume Hiiragi, Shino Ayato,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,680)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Okachimachi, Ranko Mannen, Nagomi Wahira, Zoya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all just a\Nreally bad dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's answering the damn phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Creatureland disowns\Nus, we won't survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when our sales are\Ngrowing thanks to Lady Omoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to answer everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think for yourself, stupid piglet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't come up with anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really just helpless\Nlittle piggies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this cage we call Akiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're just sitting here waiting\Nfor the day we get slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't plan on dying this young.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,235.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(622.4,571.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Yumechi has had plastic surgery.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.83,0:03:46.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(662.4,180.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}The pork at Oinky Doink is actually worm meat.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(795,298)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Without a doubt,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(853,374)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ranko is a
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(795,450)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}forty-year-old pig
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still only just 36, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm filled with doubt all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, the cafe still isn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember Akai? Huh? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one who was\Nalways dressed in red, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the body they\Nfound in the Kanda River?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Akai. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police say he may have been tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a maid did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid wouldn't go up\Nout murdering a master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He liked to brag about you\Nwhen we were at other cafes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The maids there weren't happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was kind of oblivious to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we're scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they might have us\Npegged as oinky-doink regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry we can't come home\Nto oinky-doink anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't be fans if we're freaking dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home to the pig...stye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our cafe has a strict no maids policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, piglet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just regular maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so obvious that you're maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spy some dashing masters\Nsitting right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind if we join.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, hey, that's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't fit for drinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know some better cafes that\Ndon't serve this kind of slop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's skip this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, sorry, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose master do you think\Nyou're harassing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Moo, someone's scary! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey, we have to go\Nnow, actually. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you come home again, my master!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is what a true\Npig star should look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Dazzlion was supposed to be the\Nnext Lady of Moe at the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the smelly oinkers\Nwho ignored that rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all because I\Nam the next Lady of Moe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if it is? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're disowned, you're our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me. Wanna go? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 40-year-old maid seems\Nto know what's what. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(787,367)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941,571)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ramen

